1c:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[false,[["$","section","Scholarship status must include an academic year",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Scholarship status must include an academic year"}],[["$","p","A scholarship name can remain online after its deadline. Always pair the name with the academic year, application owner and official closing time. On 29 September 2026, the MAECI and main ER.GO 2026–2027 competitions shown here are closed; future calls require new dates from their owners.",{"children":"A scholarship name can remain online after its deadline. Always pair the name with the academic year, application owner and official closing time. On 29 September 2026, the MAECI and main ER.GO 2026–2027 competitions shown here are closed; future calls require new dates from their owners."}],["$","p","University admission may open before a scholarship notice is published. Do not describe a future university award as open because the degree portal accepts applications.",{"children":"University admission may open before a scholarship notice is published. Do not describe a future university award as open because the degree portal accepts applications."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","MAECI Italian Government grants",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"MAECI Italian Government grants"}],[["$","p","MAECI publishes an annual call for foreign citizens and Italians living abroad, an eligible-country list and instructions for the Study in Italy portal. The 2026–2027 call closed at 14:00 Italian time on 26 March 2026 and covered study carried out in Italy.",{"children":"MAECI publishes an annual call for foreign citizens and Italians living abroad, an eligible-country list and instructions for the Study in Italy portal. The 2026–2027 call closed at 14:00 Italian time on 26 March 2026 and covered study carried out in Italy."}],["$","p","Before a future application, verify that your country, course type, age, academic background and language evidence meet the new call. Also confirm the grant duration, health-insurance terms, tuition treatment and any costs that remain yours.",{"children":"Before a future application, verify that your country, course type, age, academic background and language evidence meet the new call. Also confirm the grant duration, health-insurance terms, tuition treatment and any costs that remain yours."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Regional DSU scholarships",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Regional DSU scholarships"}],[["$","p","DSU is a right-to-study system administered through regional or institution-linked bodies. Names, portals, deadlines, benefit amounts and document rules vary. ER.GO serves institutions in Emilia-Romagna; other regions use different bodies and calls.",{"children":"DSU is a right-to-study system administered through regional or institution-linked bodies. Names, portals, deadlines, benefit amounts and document rules vary. ER.GO serves institutions in Emilia-Romagna; other regions use different bodies and calls."}],["$","p","Applicants whose family income or assets are outside Italy commonly need official financial and family documents, translations and legalisation or authentication that meet the relevant call. Start these documents early because admission documents alone are not enough for an economic assessment.",{"children":"Applicants whose family income or assets are outside Italy commonly need official financial and family documents, translations and legalisation or authentication that meet the relevant call. Start these documents early because admission documents alone are not enough for an economic assessment."}]],"$undefined"]}],"$L20","$L21","$L22"]]}]
